rough transient disconnection, the boot ID changed from 83a0a80f-773c-4f3e-9137-1e7aa887b07a to a054e14a-0b8c-48fb-b4cd-252b3e17b166, and the recovered node retained its account, key, SSH policy, service health, and reachability. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["No end-to-end SSH login was attempted with the corresponding private key. Access is therefore established through coherent account, exact-key, permissions, effective-policy, service-health, and reachability observations rather than a completed authenticated session.","The restart command reported that reboot was scheduled rather than returning a separate provider acknowledgement; subsequent connection loss, changed boot identity, healthy recovery, and lifecycle observations directly confirm that the restart occurred."]}
